    "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the exact adult woman from <Picture 1>.\n<Picture 1> is the sole authoritative reference for <Subject 1>'s facial identity: facial proportions, green-grey eyes, winged black eyeliner, eyebrows, nose, full lips, jawline, dense natural freckles across her nose and cheeks, fair natural skin, long voluminous wavy copper-red hair and large gold hoop earrings. The donut, the hand pose and the sideways glance in <Picture 1> are NOT part of this shot; take only her identity and appearance from it.\n<Picture 2> is a close-up crop of <Subject 1>'s face taken from <Picture 1>; use it for the exact eye shape, eyeliner, freckle pattern, nose and skin detail.\n<Audio 1> is the exact speech of this shot. Her mouth follows it with precise lip synchronization.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation + audio reference] A photorealistic, sharp close-up of the face and shoulders of <Subject 1> in a photo studio with a teal paper backdrop. She looks directly into the camera and says in Russian \"Я Мисс Фортуна.\" exactly in sync with <Audio 1>.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1>: fully_preserved - exact facial identity, facial structure, freckles, skin tone, eye shape and colour, makeup, copper-red hair and gold hoop earrings are inherited from <Picture 1>.\n<Audio 1>: reference - exact spoken words and timing drive the lip movement.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] A continuous photorealistic close-up of <Subject 1>. The framing, head position, head size, head turn and all body and camera movement stay exactly as they already are in the footage; only the face gains real detail. Her face is sharp and in focus, with two clearly defined, symmetric, natural eyes looking into the lens, natural eyelids and lashes, a well-defined nose and a clearly readable mouth with natural teeth.\nShe speaks <d>[Russian] Я Мисс Фортуна.</d> with precise, natural lip synchronization to <Audio 1>: lips, jaw and cheeks move with the Russian pronunciation while her facial structure and identity stay stable. After the phrase she closes her lips and keeps looking into the camera.\nPreserve facial identity, readable eyes and mouth. No facial morphing, no duplicated features, no warping, no face blur, no plastic skin.\n\nvisual_style:\nReal photographic footage. Natural skin microtexture, visible pores and freckles, realistic tonal variation, individual copper-red hair strands and flyaways. Soft, even studio lighting matching the surrounding frame.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nOnly the exact supplied speech from <Audio 1> and quiet studio room tone.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
